      'Cancellation terms are set for each plan. Please complete the process from My Page or by phone before the deadline stated in your confirmation email. For last-minute changes, we will check availability and advise you.',
  },
  {
    question: 'If I want to change my plan after booking, how do I do that?',
    answer:
      'Let us know your preferred dates, number of guests and room type, and we will check availability and make the switch. The front desk can explain any price difference for an upgrade and how the cancellation terms apply.',
  },
  {
    question: 'Are check-in and check-out times fixed?',
    answer:
      'Check-in is from 3:00 p.m. and check-out is by 11:00 a.m. as a guide. If you would like to arrive earlier or leave later, please contact the front desk in advance. We can often accommodate you depending on availability.',
  },
  {
    question: 'Can you accommodate allergies or ingredients I would rather avoid?',
    answer:
      'Please tell us in as much detail as possible when you book. Some ingredients are difficult to work around, but we will substitute or adjust wherever we can. Same-day changes may not be possible because of kitchen preparation.',
  },
  {
    question: 'Do the rooms have an open-air bath?',
