      'It depends on the plan and the room type. We offer rooms with a private open-air bath as well as plans that use the large communal baths only. Please check the amenities column on the booking screen or ask the front desk.',
  },
  {
    question: 'Is Wi-Fi available?',
    answer:
      'Free Wi-Fi is available throughout the ryokan. Connect using your room number and the password we provide. Please note that speeds may drop during busy periods.',
  },
  {
    question: 'Can I stay with children?',
    answer:
      'Yes. Rates for children sharing a bed and the availability of extra beds vary by plan. Cribs are limited in number, so please reserve one in advance.',
  },
  {
    question: 'Can you help with a surprise for a special occasion?',
    answer:
      'Cakes, bouquets, a message plate with your meal and more. If you talk to us in advance, we will help however we can. Tell us your budget and the timing, and we will suggest some options.',
  },
  {
